sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Correlator
  participant P as Policy / recovery
  participant D as Durable state / audit API
  actor H as Human approver
  participant O as Operator
  participant K as Kubernetes API
  C->>P: Incident with evidence and target identity
  P->>D: Persist proposal, policy version, audit intent
  P->>P: Evaluate scope, freshness, budgets, allowlist
  alt Denied, stale, or dependency unavailable
    P->>D: Persist denial reason, no action
  else Approval required and policy permits
    P-->>H: Exact proposal digest, risk, rollback, expiry
    H->>P: Scoped approval for immutable content
    P->>D: Transaction: approval, authorization, outbox
    D-->>O: Authorized request via dispatch / CR adapter
    O->>P: Recheck authorization and policy version
    P-->>O: Valid, unexpired, within budget
    O->>K: Read target UID / resourceVersion / preconditions
    K-->>O: Current observed state
    O->>D: Durable action intent before side effect
    O->>K: One allowlisted idempotent action
    O->>K: Observe bounded postcondition verification
    K-->>O: Success, failure, timeout, or unknown
    O->>D: Record result, rollback/escalation if policy permits
    D-->>H: Outbox notification, redacted evidence
  end
